        <detaileddescription>
<para>Create Chunk Embed Step.</para>
<para>For every <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_text_chunk" kindref="compound">TextChunk</ref></computeroutput> in <computeroutput>ctx.chunks</computeroutput>, computes a dense embedding via <computeroutput>backend</computeroutput> and appends a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_vector_record" kindref="compound">VectorRecord</ref></computeroutput> to <computeroutput>ctx.embeddings</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>If <computeroutput>backend</computeroutput> is <computeroutput>nullptr</computeroutput>, a <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_null_embedding_backend" kindref="compound">NullEmbeddingBackend</ref></computeroutput> (768-d, zero vectors) is used automatically; <computeroutput>isAvailable()</computeroutput> will be false so no real inference occurs but the step succeeds without error — useful for tests.</para>
<para>Config keys (all optional):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>skip_when_unavailable</computeroutput> bool default true — if true and backend is unavailable, the step is a no-op instead of an error.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>dims</computeroutput> number Hint for <ref refid="classthemis_1_1ingestion_1_1_null_embedding_backend" kindref="compound">NullEmbeddingBackend</ref> dimensionality (default 768).</para>
